escription><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/25/treasury-yields-bonds-inflation.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 07:44:24 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 马来西亚表示现在看到美国芯片限制的影响还为时过早</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/malaysia-says-too-early-to-see-impact-of-us-chip-curbs-video</link><description>马来西亚投资发展局主席兼马来西亚总理高级政治顾问扎夫鲁·阿齐兹认为，现在判断美国芯片限制的影响还为时过早。美国最近宣布将对新加坡、泰国、马来西亚、印度尼西亚和巴西的先进人工智能芯片出口实施更严格的控制。他与哈斯琳达·阿明就“哈斯琳达·阿明的见解”进行了交谈。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/malaysia-says-too-early-to-see-impact-of-us-chip-curbs-video'&gt;马来西亚表示现在看到美国芯片限制的影响还为时过早&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Malaysia Says Too Early to See Impact of US Chip Curbs&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/malaysia-says-too-early-to-see-impact-of-us-chip-curbs-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 07:48:37 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 英国取暖费飙升26%，加剧通胀压力</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-25/uk-heating-bills-surge-26-adding-to-inflation-pressure</link><description>英国监管机构将能源价格上限提高 26%&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-25/uk-heating-bills-surge-26-adding-to-inflation-pressure'&gt;英国取暖费飙升26%，加剧通胀压力&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：UK Heating Bills Surge 26%, Adding to Inflation Pressure&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-25/uk-heating-bills-surge-26-adding-to-inflation-pressure</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 07:51:47 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[金融时报] 随着人工智能担忧卷土重来，华尔街将跟随亚洲市场走低</title><link>https://www.ft.com/content/705eb84c-801d-4a96-b908-e366511e886a?syn-25a6b1a6=1</link><description>黄仁勋的反弹消退后，东京和首尔的科技股遭受重创&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[金融时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.ft.com/content/705eb84c-801d-4a96-b908-e366511e886a?syn-25a6b1a6=1'&gt;随着人工智能担忧卷土重来，华尔街将跟随亚洲市场走低&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Wall Street set to follow Asian markets lower as AI fears return&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.ft.com/content/705eb84c-801d-4a96-b908-e366511e886a?syn-25a6b1a6=1</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 07:54:11 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 中国斥美国关税前景为“政治操纵”</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/china-dismisses-us-tariff-prospect-as-political-maneuvering</link><description>中国称美国对其出口征收新关税的前景是“政治操纵”，并表示两国应共同努力维持贸易休战。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/china-dismisses-us-tariff-prospect-as-political-maneuvering'&gt;中国斥美国关税前景为“政治操纵”&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：China Dismisses US Tariff Prospect as ‘Political Maneuvering’&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/china-dismisses-us-tariff-prospect-as-political-maneuvering</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 07:57:21 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[CNBC等2家] Nasdaq futures slide amid reports of fresh U.S. tariffs as tech sell-off intensifies: Live updates</title><link>https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/24/stock-market-today-live-updates-.html</link><description>华尔街正经历标准普尔 500 指数和纳斯达克综合指数的下跌。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 2 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[CNBC]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/24/stock-market-today-live-updates-.html'&gt;Nasdaq futures slide amid reports of fresh U.S. tariffs as tech sell-off intensifies: Live updates&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nasdaq futures slide amid reports of fresh U.S. tariffs as tech sell-off intensifies: Live updates&lt;/small&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/